      "description": "<p data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2372\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2323\">Natalie Cole – Natalie</strong><br data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2326\">\nCapitol Records ST-11517<br data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2353\">\n1976 U.S. Stereo LP<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2472\">Classic mid-1970s Natalie Cole album featuring a mix of soul, R&amp;B, funk and smooth pop production.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2486\"><strong data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2486\">Side One</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2620\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1e2nsa7\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2499\">\nMr. Melody\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fyuqyq\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2520\">\nHeaven Is With You\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hbsc31\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2566\">\nSophisticated Lady (She’s a Different Lady)\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q2hisu\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2592\">\nNo Plans for the Future\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"re6k5u\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2620\">\nCan We Get Together Again\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2634\"><strong data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2634\">Side Two</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2721\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev8420\" data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2649\">\nKeep Smiling\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1br61io\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2674\">\nGood Morning Heartache\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ndxxx5\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2690\">\nNot Like Mine\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"iev15x\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2701\">\nTouch Me\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jbsfg1\" data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2721\">\nHard to Get Along\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2770\">Produced by <strong data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2769\">Chuck Jackson and Marvin Yancy</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"3006\"><strong data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2786\">Condition:</strong> Vinyl visually graded VG with light surface marks/hairlines from normal use. Jacket graded VG with age-related edge/corner wear, light surface wear and a visible crease on the front cover. Labels are clean and readable.</p>",
